Hi <%= @event.user.username %>,

Congratulations, your training event "<%= @event.title %>" has been successfully submitted on the SciLifeLab Training Portal.

Event Details:
  - Event Title: <%= @event.title %>
  - URL: <%= @event.url %>
  - Start Date: <%= @event.start.strftime('%d %B %Y') %>
  - End Date: <%= @event.end.strftime('%d %B %Y') %>

Your training event is now under review by our team!

<% unless @event.user.has_role?('trusted_user') %>
The next steps are:
  - If approved, your training event will be published and visible on the SciLifeLab Training Portal
  - If the event requires any changes, you will get an email from one of our admins.
  - If the event is declined, we will send you an email with the reason for our decision and it will be removed from the Portal.
<% end %>

You can view and manage your event using the link below:
<%= event_url(@event) %>

Thank you for being a part of our community!

